th white hair is a researcher, 24 years old.\nHe is a man who is regarded as a genius by both himself and others, but he has a bad mouth and a big attitude, but he is so-so and loves people.\n\nTheir relationship is that of colleagues, but recently they have been getting along well despite their arguments, and they often go out for meals.\nThe detective is better at cooking meals than I am, so I would be happy if you could draw a picture involving food. (I am happy to wear any of the outfits in the link)\n\nI will leave the composition of the picture to you.\nIf you like, please consider.\n\nI will consider it if you like.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-fOT9Fq0v4ugHiR1vz-t1ijD96YVvEm8", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@moya_ch_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 772494, "client_id": 1723965, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/13039e61/uploads/origins/5f0f7bae-9ff2-48d7-9162-e1fd24acf981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=211239aac52823c9f51ae7a65ba53dac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/13039e61/uploads/origins/5f0f7bae-9ff2-48d7-9162-e1fd24acf981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=211239aac52823c9f51ae7a65ba53dac, https://si.imgix.net/13039e61/uploads/origins/5f0f7bae-9ff2-48d7-9162-e1fd24acf981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b033666d0dce3199100156b7d8b8d922 2x, https://si.imgix.net/13039e61/uploads/origins/5f0f7bae-9ff2-48d7-9162-e1fd24acf981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02334647d05b02a5a9dcf7f54340a502 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/13039e61/uploads/origins/5f0f7bae-9ff2-48d7-9162-e1fd24acf981?bg=%23fff&auto=form